--- TS1 (PMF_react_prod/US) ---

Umbrella-sampling window set along 'dD', seeded from ../../SMD/TS1/ (see ../README). 100
window subfolders per replica, static restraint on 'dD' at each window's value (kappa=300,
consistent with this system's softer SMD kappa) plus the same background Mg-coordination /
distance / angle walls as the SMD stage. WHAM complete for all three replicas
('WHAM/fepreact_TS1_ppimg2.out').

Three replicas (rep1/2/3) -- one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
